{
  "title": { "zh": "逆用概括" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:exI\"></part-ref>写成规则是 ⟦?P(?t)⟧ ⟹ ∃x. ?P(x)。?t 是代表一样东西的元变量：倒着用时，例子无法从目标读出，?t 就留着。<level-ref to=\"q-exI\"></level-ref>里，有几句「存在」时要在元件上选得出哪一句；倒着用规则，目标自己就说明了。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-exI",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "∃x. Human(x) ∧ Likes(x, i)", "hyps": ["Human(j)", "Likes(j, i)"] },
        { "goal": "∃x. Bird(x) ∧ Flies(x)", "hyps": ["Flies(k)", "Bird(k)"] },
        { "goal": "∃y. Student(y) ∧ School(y)", "hyps": ["Student(l)", "School(l)"] }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "例子是谁，交给已知去定。" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = exI()",
        "c1r0 = andI()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = assumption(c1)",
        "c3 = assumption(c2)",
        "out <- c3"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
